# the argument of river-promise.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
atom	made_release_made	the one to whom it is made can release the one who made it
atom	bind(x)	x: binds
atom	promise(x)	x: promise
atom	release_speak_will(x)	x: can release one for it neither speaks nor wills
atom	river(x)	x: river
atom	bind_solemnly_spoken(x)	x: does bind however solemnly it was spoken on the bank
atom	promise_made_river(x)	x: promise made to a river
P1	S1	((all x: promise(x) -> bind(x)) -> made_release_made)
P2	S2	(all x: river(x) -> !release_speak_will(x))
C	S3	(all x: promise_made_river(x) -> !bind_solemnly_spoken(x))
# rules tool=phil/skeleton date=2026-10-20
